// Issue #1267 N1/N2 (slice 2) — the path-triggered legs:
//
// Slice 1 (gh-1350) landed flutter-app-exzone path-BLIND under the SM's
// dispatch-only CI: it ran on EVERY validation dispatch, because the paths
